777
01:33:28,190 --> 01:33:30,900
I'm in great pain, Kalonoz.

778
01:33:33,570 --> 01:33:36,290
And I can't stand this pain anymore.

779
01:33:37,890 --> 01:33:41,890
This longing for you, hurts my insides.

780
01:33:43,510 --> 01:33:46,140
I want to be with you already, Kalonoz.

781
01:33:47,750 --> 01:33:50,380
I also want that a lot.

782
01:33:51,450 --> 01:33:53,100
But Tekfur...

783
01:33:53,100 --> 01:33:55,000
Tekfur Yorgopolos.

784
01:33:55,000 --> 01:33:57,900
How could we do that to him?

785
01:33:59,440 --> 01:34:03,110
God.. If God didn't want us
to be together...

786
01:34:03,720 --> 01:34:06,650
... would he give this love to us?

787
01:34:09,230 --> 01:34:11,260
Kalonoz...

788
01:34:13,810 --> 01:34:16,710
You're my greatest test in this world.

789
01:34:19,500 --> 01:34:21,280
Every day...

790
01:34:21,950 --> 01:34:25,350
...every night, I'm in pain because
of your longing.

791
01:34:26,330 --> 01:34:29,390
I die every time I see you with Tekfur.

792
01:34:32,820 --> 01:34:35,950
But what are we going to do, Sofia?

793
01:34:37,690 --> 01:34:40,290
What can we do?

794
01:34:43,750 --> 01:34:46,040
Allow me, Kalonoz..

795
01:34:46,850 --> 01:34:49,840
I'll consult the stars tonight, and
tomorrow night...

796
01:34:50,620 --> 01:34:53,110
...I'll inform you.

797
01:34:53,460 --> 01:34:57,460
I'll wait for it like no other
news I've waited for.

798
01:35:02,430 --> 01:35:03,940
Allah almighty...

799
01:35:04,780 --> 01:35:11,070
...let me revenge my brother Aybars,
and our martyr's like him.

800
01:35:16,850 --> 01:35:22,180
Don't you worry. Don't even shed a tear.

801
01:35:25,330 --> 01:35:29,330
Keep your head upright. Keep your
head upright.

802
01:35:29,950 --> 01:35:31,700
Bamsı...

803
01:35:31,870 --> 01:35:34,090
...has become a martyr's father.

804
01:35:34,330 --> 01:35:36,700
A martyr's father, Bamsı has become.

805
01:36:52,120 --> 01:36:54,230
Why are you so dreamy?

806
01:36:54,430 --> 01:36:56,360
What are you thinking about?

807
01:36:57,120 --> 01:36:58,530
Nothing.

808
01:36:58,620 --> 01:37:00,500
I daydreamed.

809
01:37:01,860 --> 01:37:04,210
Come on already, smile.

810
01:37:05,150 --> 01:37:06,810
Look, we're really close

811
01:37:06,990 --> 01:37:08,340
You're right.

812
01:37:08,770 --> 01:37:10,380
We've come very close.

813
01:37:11,800 --> 01:37:14,590
We'll have completed our duty tomorrow.

814
01:37:15,540 --> 01:37:17,790
Are you upset because of this?

815
01:37:20,650 --> 01:37:22,910
Come on, smile some.

816
01:37:25,640 --> 01:37:27,560
Or are you...

817
01:37:28,860 --> 01:37:30,840
...thinking about him?

818
01:37:32,530 --> 01:37:34,220
About who?

819
01:37:35,160 --> 01:37:37,170
The Turk you saved.

820
01:37:39,440 --> 01:37:41,320
I wonder who he was.

821
01:37:42,010 --> 01:37:43,920
What was he looking for there?

822
01:37:43,930 --> 01:37:47,930
I don't know who he is. But it's certain
that he's in your mind.

823
01:37:48,930 --> 01:37:51,480
One shouldn't tell you anything.

824
01:37:51,890 --> 01:37:56,440
We need to rest. We have a lot to
do tomorrow.

825
01:37:56,870 --> 01:37:58,570
Come on.

826
01:39:47,010 --> 01:39:49,440
Whites...

827
01:39:53,720 --> 01:39:55,310
If...

828
01:39:57,230 --> 01:40:00,240
...there a whites in my hairs..

829
01:40:05,700 --> 01:40:11,570
..they fell from the wings of the angels
who carry my Aybars.

830
01:40:19,360 --> 01:40:22,130
They fell from their wings.

831
01:40:41,960 --> 01:40:43,850
Bamsı Bey...

832
01:40:45,830 --> 01:40:48,890
A martyr's smell, is heavens smell.

833
01:40:54,040 --> 01:41:00,270
Now it's time to bury our brother, to
scatter his scent to the Kayı Tent.

834
01:42:06,710 --> 01:42:11,340
Come on, come on then valiants.

835
01:42:35,230 --> 01:42:39,230
"We take refuge from the accursed Satan"
(Basmala)

836
01:42:41,180 --> 01:42:45,690
"In the name of God, the infinitely
Compassionate and Merciful." (Basmala).

837
01:42:46,290 --> 01:42:52,100
[Quran Yā sīn:36]
"Ya-Sin. By the Qur´an, full of Wisdom."

838
01:42:52,490 --> 01:42:57,330
"Indeed you, [O Muhammad],
are from among the messengers,"

839
01:42:57,490 --> 01:43:03,220
"On a straight path."

840
01:43:03,740 --> 01:43:08,730
"[This is] a Revelation sent down by (Him),
the Exalted in Might, Most Merciful.:

841
01:43:08,840 --> 01:43:10,760
-Allah is great!

842
01:43:10,760 --> 01:43:15,340
"That you may warn a people
whose forefathers were not ...

843
01:43:15,340 --> 01:43:20,100
...warned, so they are unaware.
(of the Signs of Allah)."

844
01:43:21,620 --> 01:43:31,380
"Already the word has come into effect upon most of them, so they do not believe."

845
01:43:32,180 --> 01:43:38,810
"We placed shackles around their necks, up to their chins, ...

846
01:43:38,820 --> 01:43:44,980
...so they are stiff-necked."

847
01:44:38,740 --> 01:44:40,890
Peace be upon you.

848
01:44:40,890 --> 01:44:42,540
Are your goods fresh?

849
01:44:42,820 --> 01:44:45,480
They're fresh my Bey, here.

850
01:44:56,140 --> 01:44:58,060
Giddy up!

851
01:45:49,480 --> 01:45:51,490
What do you want from me?

852
01:45:51,670 --> 01:45:53,220
Who are you?

853
01:45:57,380 --> 01:46:00,160
Do you know who I am? I'm a castle
employee.

854
01:46:00,450 --> 01:46:02,450
You can't do anything to me.

855
01:46:05,340 --> 01:46:09,340
Let go! Let go! Let me go!

856
01:46:11,030 --> 01:46:15,030
I have lots of coins. I'll give you
all you want. Let go!

857
01:46:17,660 --> 01:46:20,500
Don't worry, we'll give you the coins.

858
01:46:25,430 --> 01:46:29,100
[Quran Al-Fatiha  (The opening) 1:7]
Read and pray for him.

859
01:46:29,140 --> 01:46:32,260
"In the name of God, the infinitely
Compassionate and Merciful."

860
01:46:32,340 --> 01:46:34,580
"Praise be to Allah,
Lord of all the worlds."

861
01:46:34,600 --> 01:46:37,660
"The Compassionate, the Merciful.
Ruler on the Day of Reckoning."

862
01:46:37,680 --> 01:46:40,340
You alone do we worship, and
You alone do we ask for help."

863
01:46:40,350 --> 01:46:41,780
"Guide us on the straight path,"

864
01:46:41,790 --> 01:46:44,740
"The path of those who
have received your grace"

865
01:46:44,750 --> 01:46:48,660
"not the path of those who have brought
down wrath, nor of those who wander astray."

866
01:46:48,670 --> 01:46:51,410
"Ameen"

867
01:47:51,940 --> 01:47:54,310
We've lost my Aybars.

868
01:47:56,340 --> 01:48:00,170
We've lost my Aybars.

869
01:48:02,000 --> 01:48:05,490
And now we...

870
01:48:06,010 --> 01:48:08,410
...have buried him.

871
01:48:10,690 --> 01:48:11,730
But...

872
01:48:13,080 --> 01:48:14,220
..we...

873
01:48:14,990 --> 01:48:17,950
...don't place a valiant's sword...

874
01:48:18,940 --> 01:48:21,250
...until he's avenged!

875
01:48:55,950 --> 01:48:57,530
Osman...

876
01:49:04,870 --> 01:49:06,480
My Osman...

877
01:49:07,300 --> 01:49:08,640
Son..

878
01:49:13,750 --> 01:49:16,870
From now on, this sword is yours.

879
01:49:18,660 --> 01:49:23,410
My friend, until we avenge Aybars..

880
01:49:24,330 --> 01:49:27,080
...carry this with you.

881
01:49:27,290 --> 01:49:30,160
Don't you worry, my Bamsı Bey.

882
01:49:30,610 --> 01:49:34,610
The only place Aybars' killers will run
to, is their deaths!

883
01:49:44,800 --> 01:49:46,570
I swear on my...

884
01:49:48,220 --> 01:49:52,220
...friend, my blood brother Aybars'
dark sword...

885
01:49:53,520 --> 01:49:59,440
...this sword, will be the end of
those who killed him.

886
01:50:08,510 --> 01:50:09,800
Alps(Men)!

887
01:50:10,320 --> 01:50:12,260
Don't you forget.

888
01:50:13,030 --> 01:50:16,530
Each of you, are Azans!

889
01:50:16,740 --> 01:50:18,910
May you not cease!

890
01:50:19,070 --> 01:50:21,890
Each one of you, are flags!

891
01:50:22,460 --> 01:50:24,680
May you not go down!

892
01:50:27,040 --> 01:50:29,370
Each one of you...

893
01:50:30,010 --> 01:50:32,120
...like my child Aybars..

894
01:50:32,800 --> 01:50:35,000
..valiants!

895
01:50:35,780 --> 01:50:39,530
May you give your lives!

896
01:50:39,750 --> 01:50:42,410
But, may you not die!

897
01:50:43,440 --> 01:50:46,080
But, may you not die valiants!

898
01:50:46,080 --> 01:53:48,080
www.kurulusosman.online

899
01:54:28,140 --> 01:54:32,140
-Efendi Yanis.
-I know everything, Sofia.

900
01:54:37,210 --> 01:54:41,380
If it weren't for your guard Mekala,
you could have caught...

901
01:54:41,380 --> 01:54:44,450
one of the assassins and make him
talk in our favor.

902
01:54:53,900 --> 01:54:57,900
Tell me about Ertuğrul's son Osman, Sofia.

903
01:55:02,890 --> 01:55:06,450
His father had his knife at our hearts.

904
01:55:06,450 --> 01:55:07,710
But his son...

905
01:55:12,300 --> 01:55:14,170
...Osman..

906
01:55:15,810 --> 01:55:18,320
His eyes look like a predator's.

907
01:55:21,850 --> 01:55:25,300
He has stabbed us with his unlucky
knife already.

908
01:55:26,290 --> 01:55:30,880
I'm afraid he doesn't look like he'll let
us go without carving our insides.

909
01:55:34,230 --> 01:55:38,490
Tonight, I want Tekfur's corpse...

910
01:55:39,290 --> 01:55:41,380
...and Kalonoz' soul.

911
01:55:45,060 --> 01:55:47,220
Now about Osman...

912
01:55:47,740 --> 01:55:52,410
His fate won't be any different
from his friend's.

913
01:58:22,500 --> 01:58:26,710
As you ordered, my Bey. This cart will
go up to the castle's heart.

914
01:58:27,120 --> 01:58:29,390
I'll be alone when we get inside
the castle.

915
01:58:29,820 --> 01:58:32,240
You be ready at the door.

916
01:58:32,330 --> 01:58:36,750
If anything goes wrong, we'll have
to fight our way out.

917
01:58:37,510 --> 01:58:39,580
Bismillah.

918
01:58:40,980 --> 01:58:43,530
-May Allah help us all.
-Amen.

919
01:58:53,450 --> 01:58:56,030
With Osman, his Alps (Men) also went
with him.

920
01:58:57,340 --> 01:58:58,820
Oran, Erkut, Boğaç.

921
01:58:59,670 --> 01:59:01,770
He made them like him.

922
01:59:02,200 --> 01:59:06,200
He'll drag him like a flood.

923
01:59:07,270 --> 01:59:10,160
What is this madman's problem, huh?
What is it?

924
01:59:10,160 --> 01:59:12,330
Revenge.

925
01:59:13,560 --> 01:59:15,810
Only if my father knew this.

926
01:59:15,810 --> 01:59:19,230
What revenge will he get as an apprentice?

927
01:59:20,920 --> 01:59:24,400
Looks like he sees himself responsible
for what happened to Aybars.

928
01:59:25,780 --> 01:59:29,780
Osman is right only in this matter.

929
01:59:30,820 --> 01:59:34,400
If he thinks like this, he's right.

930
01:59:35,220 --> 01:59:39,220
For what happened to Aybars, he's
responsible.

931
01:59:39,880 --> 01:59:45,680
But, what is going after revenge,
seeking blood alone?

932
01:59:45,940 --> 01:59:51,200
This Tent, why are we here, Gündüz?

933
01:59:51,790 --> 01:59:55,620
This is the border. Here, we eat sheep
with the wolf...

934
01:59:56,300 --> 02:00:00,940
...then, cry with the shepherd.

935
02:00:08,290 --> 02:00:09,830
Uncle..

936
02:00:11,470 --> 02:00:14,290
Let him come back if Allah permits...

937
02:00:14,290 --> 02:00:17,380
...then I'll give him such a lesson...

938
02:00:17,380 --> 02:00:18,890
...don't you worry.

939
02:00:19,080 --> 02:00:21,620
This is not a lesson matter, my nephew.

940
02:00:22,650 --> 02:00:27,290
The chain that'll stop him, is in
my brother's hands.

941
02:00:27,470 --> 02:00:30,390
He'll only listen to him.

942
02:00:30,530 --> 02:00:35,180
Living with the fear of what will be
his next move...

943
02:00:36,410 --> 02:00:38,420
...has tired me.

944
02:00:44,960 --> 02:00:49,410
Only if my brother could come back
from Konya...

945
02:00:49,680 --> 02:00:53,680
...then I could rest a little.

946
02:01:03,750 --> 02:01:04,820
Stop!

947
02:01:06,420 --> 02:01:08,680
Where is Aleksis? Who are you?

948
02:01:08,910 --> 02:01:12,910
I'm Aleksis' cousin. He needs to rest for
a few days.

949
02:01:20,190 --> 02:01:22,080
Okay, go through.

950
02:01:33,920 --> 02:01:35,560
Hey, driver!

951
02:01:38,570 --> 02:01:40,040
What do you have in the car?

952
02:01:40,760 --> 02:01:44,660
- I brought wine for the castle kitchen.
- Isn't it also our right do drink from...

953
02:01:44,660 --> 02:01:46,080
..these beautiful wines?

954
02:01:46,080 --> 02:01:47,480
Of course it is.

955
02:02:07,010 --> 02:02:10,040
It's good. Now go.

956
02:03:10,310 --> 02:03:14,310
Your power, brings the
moon down from the sky.

957
02:03:15,030 --> 02:03:19,030
To your magic, the stars above fall down.

958
02:03:44,080 --> 02:03:45,360
Come in.

959
02:03:55,920 --> 02:03:58,250
The time has come, Helen.

960
02:04:00,030 --> 02:04:03,010
Let lovers come together now.

961
02:04:05,260 --> 02:04:09,260
Sofia, what if we don't succeed?

962
02:04:12,430 --> 02:04:16,430
Pessimism doesn't suit the souls
devoted to our holy father, Helen.

963
02:04:16,950 --> 02:04:20,420
Go, open hope's door.

964
02:04:30,430 --> 02:04:32,250
Be careful!

965
02:04:34,520 --> 02:04:36,380
Bring that barrel too.

966
02:04:53,060 --> 02:04:56,430
We took that much trouble,
can't leave without tasting it.

967
02:05:14,530 --> 02:05:17,260
This is where we're at. The cellar.

968
02:05:18,080 --> 02:05:22,080
I'll go from here, and enter Tekfur's
room from the balcony here.

969
02:05:25,660 --> 02:05:29,660
Now go to the Alps (Men). Tell them
to watch everywhere. Streets, entrances...

970
02:05:29,690 --> 02:05:32,490
Okay, my Bey.
What about him, my Bey?

971
02:06:12,920 --> 02:06:16,920
Don't worry, Tekfur Yorgopolos.
It's me, Osman.

972
02:06:26,460 --> 02:06:28,250
Osman Bey.

973
02:06:30,520 --> 02:06:34,700
What are you doing here like this?

974
02:06:36,660 --> 02:06:41,360
We're both after the same thing,
Yorgopolos.

975
02:06:44,020 --> 02:06:47,880
The arrows shot at you, didn't
hit their targets. But...

976
02:06:48,080 --> 02:06:51,450
...after they got out of the castle, they
reached my brother Aybars.

977
02:06:53,910 --> 02:06:56,230
To Bamsı Bey's son Aybars?

978
02:06:57,840 --> 02:07:00,460
They killed him.

979
02:07:05,400 --> 02:07:08,500
They wanted to kill me because I saved
your life in the Castle

980
02:07:11,570 --> 02:07:13,870
But my brother paid for this.

981
02:07:14,820 --> 02:07:17,380
We are deceived, Osman.

982
02:07:17,630 --> 02:07:20,500
Don't seek them outside, Yorgopolos.

983
02:07:21,670 --> 02:07:26,320
Obviously, you have been betrayed.

984
02:07:32,900 --> 02:07:35,190
I don't trust even your best men.

985
02:07:49,870 --> 02:07:52,410
How can we reveal those traitors?

986
02:07:52,450 --> 02:07:54,490
Who do you trust the most in the castle?

987
02:07:54,590 --> 02:07:58,590
My wife Sofia, my Commander Kalanos,
and his assistant Andreas.

988
02:08:02,110 --> 02:08:03,890
Will we consult them?

989
02:08:03,900 --> 02:08:06,810
No. We will start with them.

990
02:08:07,820 --> 02:08:10,500
They do not betray me.

991
02:08:10,540 --> 02:08:14,350
Treason comes from the nearest.

992
02:08:15,110 --> 02:08:19,880
Let it be.
We'll see if they are innocent.

993
02:08:21,890 --> 02:08:23,620
What I want from you is that...

994
02:08:23,660 --> 02:08:28,760
you let my three most trusted Alp (men)
in your Castle.

995
02:08:29,340 --> 02:08:32,460
Let me, so we can find the traitor.

996
02:08:32,630 --> 02:08:37,190
Then, we will sink into the treason like
this arrow.

997
02:08:38,680 --> 02:08:43,410
From now on, we are destiny brothers,
Yorgopolos.

998
02:08:52,040 --> 02:08:53,810
Deal, Osman Bey.

999
02:09:00,130 --> 02:09:01,560
Osman stop.

1000
02:09:16,030 --> 02:09:18,890
The square must be crowded.

1001
02:09:19,210 --> 02:09:21,870
It is not right for you to get out
from the balcony.

1002
02:09:25,580 --> 02:09:27,960
Osman, hide here.

1003
02:09:40,450 --> 02:09:43,070
Guard, what was that noise?

1004
02:09:43,430 --> 02:09:44,970
Check it.

1005
02:09:49,240 --> 02:09:51,390
You, bring me wine.

1006
02:10:00,280 --> 02:10:01,780
Osman, come.

1007
02:10:03,520 --> 02:10:05,670
God help us all, Osman.

1008
02:10:08,750 --> 02:10:09,920
Osman?

1009
02:10:22,520 --> 02:10:26,520
What is Osman doing in
the governor's room?

1010
02:11:08,130 --> 02:11:09,190
Come!

1011
02:11:13,400 --> 02:11:14,710
Respected Tekfur.

1012
02:11:15,030 --> 02:11:19,030
- I need to tell you something.
- What is it?

1013
02:11:20,870 --> 02:11:25,930
But, I have to ask you to
spare my life before that, sir.

1014
02:11:26,160 --> 02:11:31,120
If you want me to spare your life,
then you brought me the bad news.

1015
02:11:32,040 --> 02:11:33,010
What is it?

1016
02:11:34,530 --> 02:11:38,530
- Are you going to spare my life, sir?
- Just talk!

1017
02:11:41,200 --> 02:11:45,200
Sir, I saw a terrible thing.
Your wife...

1018
02:11:45,210 --> 02:11:49,210
... Princess Sofia is cheating on you!

1019
02:11:54,300 --> 02:11:55,560
Are you sure?

1020
02:11:58,000 --> 02:12:01,140
I saw it with my own eyes, sir.

1021
02:12:11,510 --> 02:12:14,110
How could you do this to me?

1022
02:12:14,240 --> 02:12:18,240
How could you do this to me, Sofia?

1023
02:12:46,660 --> 02:12:49,170
-Kalonoz!
- Sofia, my love!

1024
02:12:50,170 --> 02:12:54,170
- What did the stars say?
- They said we will have each other at last.

1025
02:12:54,780 --> 02:12:56,460
I will never leave you.

1026
02:12:57,180 --> 02:12:59,160
I am so happy to be
able to touch you.

1027
02:13:23,270 --> 02:13:24,310
Sofia.

1028
02:13:26,730 --> 02:13:27,660
Kalanos!

1029
02:13:28,100 --> 02:13:32,100
- Governor Yorgopolos, listen to me.
- God damn you two!

1030
02:13:35,130 --> 02:13:40,410
I loved him, I didn't stop myself, it is
all my fault Yorgopolos, please leave him.

1031
02:13:40,830 --> 02:13:41,880
Kill me.

1032
02:13:43,330 --> 02:13:47,330
Damn the day I loved you, Sofia.

1033
02:13:47,730 --> 02:13:48,370
Die!

1034
02:14:17,020 --> 02:14:18,790
He's dead, my love.

1035
02:14:22,000 --> 02:14:23,800
My love, he's dead!

1036
02:14:57,650 --> 02:15:00,200
- We are free at last.
- Not yet.

1037
02:15:04,200 --> 02:15:07,550
They can't find this body here.

1038
02:15:14,460 --> 02:15:20,700
After we throw him away, let us
go to our rooms and play our game.

1039
02:15:23,870 --> 02:15:24,830
Come on.

1040
02:15:42,660 --> 02:15:46,120
- Hurry, Boray Alp, we're leaving.
- Have you seen the governor, my Bey?

1041
02:16:00,400 --> 02:16:02,310
He's dead, my Bey.

1042
02:16:02,720 --> 02:16:05,910
Let's go, if they find out we
are here, they will blame us!

1043
02:16:06,210 --> 02:16:08,640
We won't leave until we
find out what is going on.

1044
02:16:09,240 --> 02:16:11,110
Wait for my word.

1045
02:18:33,040 --> 02:18:34,260
I know you.

1046
02:18:40,200 --> 02:18:43,520
You were the one who saved
my life in the swamp.

1047
02:19:08,780 --> 02:19:10,980
I thought you were an angel.

1048
02:19:25,360 --> 02:19:26,930
Leave here.

1049
02:19:27,720 --> 02:19:29,580
Speak first, who are you?

1050
02:19:32,760 --> 02:19:35,680
You asked for it, then come and find out.

1051
02:19:52,320 --> 02:19:58,140
Then let's find out who is
hiding behind this angelic face.

1052
02:19:58,140 --> 02:20:11,530
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com